---
import './benefits.css';
---
<figure class="benefit-figure" data-benefit-cost>
  <div class="figure-heading"><span class="figure-number">Figure 3</span>A faster mean, with slower misses</div>
  <div class="scene">
    <div class="cost-options"><label>Hits out of 20 <input data-hits type="range" min="0" max="20" value="16" /><output data-hit-count>16</output></label><label>Source and assembly <select data-source><option value="20">20 ms</option><option value="2">2 ms</option></select></label></div>
    <div class="cost-path"><strong>No cache</strong><div class="segments"><span data-baseline>Source + assembly: 20 ms</span></div><b data-no-total>20 ms</b></div>
    <div class="cost-path"><strong>Hit</strong><div class="segments"><span>Lookup + checks: 2 ms</span></div><b>2 ms</b></div>
    <div class="cost-path"><strong>Miss</strong><div class="segments"><span>Lookup: 2 ms</span><span data-source-segment>Source + assembly: 20 ms</span><span>Fill: 3 ms</span></div><b data-miss-total>25 ms</b></div>
    <div class="time-chart" aria-hidden="true">
      <div><span>No cache</span><div class="time-track"><i data-time-source style="width:80%"></i></div><span>20 ms</span></div>
      <div><span>Hit</span><div class="time-track"><i class="lookup" style="width:8%"></i></div><span>2 ms</span></div>
      <div><span>Miss</span><div class="time-track"><i class="lookup" style="width:8%"></i><i data-time-source style="width:80%"></i><i class="fill" style="width:12%"></i></div><span data-time-miss>25 ms</span></div>
      <p>One scale: every full track is 25 ms. Lookup · source · fill</p>
    </div>
    <p><strong>Twenty requests, sorted fastest first</strong></p>
    <div class="population" data-population aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:20},(_,i)=><span class:list={{hit:i<16,percentile:i===18}}>{i<16?'H':'M'}<small>{i+1}</small></span>)}</div>
    <p class="legend">H = hit · M = miss · the outlined 19th request is the model’s p95.</p>
    <p class="callout" data-result aria-live="polite">16 hits at 2 ms and 4 misses at 25 ms give a mean of 6.6 ms. The 19th request takes 25 ms, so p95 is 25 ms. Four source reads remain.</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Invented constant times: cache lookup and checks C = 2 ms, source and assembly S = 20 ms initially, and a synchronous fill W = 3 ms. One lookup per request, no failures, refreshes, overlap or queueing. Source time stays unchanged by caching. Common response work is omitted. These are model results, not Redis measurements.</figcaption>
  <details><summary>The calculation, as text</summary><p>A hit costs C. A miss costs C + S + W. For hit fraction h, the mean is hC + (1 − h)(C + S + W), or C + (1 − h)(S + W). The model sorts 20 times and takes the 19th (the nearest-rank definition) for p95. Changing the controls recalculates the sentence above.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-benefit-cost]').forEach(root => {
    const hits = root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-hits]')!;
    const source = root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-source]')!;
    const update = () => {
      const n = Number(hits.value), s = Number(source.value), miss = s + 5;
      root.querySelector('[data-hit-count]')!.textContent=String(n);
      root.querySelector('[data-baseline]')!.textContent=`Source + assembly: ${s} ms`;
      root.querySelector('[data-source-segment]')!.textContent=`Source + assembly: ${s} ms`;
      root.querySelector('[data-no-total]')!.textContent=`${s} ms`;
      root.querySelector('[data-miss-total]')!.textContent=`${miss} ms`;
      root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-time-source]').forEach(bar=>bar.style.width=`${s*4}%`);
      root.querySelector('[data-time-miss]')!.textContent=`${miss} ms`;
      root.querySelector('.time-chart > div > span:last-child')!.textContent=`${s} ms`;
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-population] > span').forEach((cell,i) => { cell.classList.toggle('hit',i<n); cell.firstChild!.textContent=i<n?'H':'M'; });
      const mean=(n*2+(20-n)*miss)/20, p95=n>=19?2:miss;
      root.querySelector('[data-result]')!.textContent=`${n} hits at 2 ms and ${20-n} misses at ${miss} ms give a mean of ${Number(mean.toFixed(2))} ms. The 19th request takes ${p95} ms, so p95 is ${p95} ms. ${20-n} source reads remain.`;
    };
    hits.addEventListener('input',update); source.addEventListener('change',update); update();
  });
</script>
<style>
 .time-chart { margin:1rem 0; }
 .time-chart>div { display:grid;grid-template-columns:5rem 1fr 3rem;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;font-size:.78rem;margin:.65rem 0; }
 .time-track { display:flex;height:18px;background:var(--color-surface);outline:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); }
 .time-track i { display:block;height:100%;background:var(--teal);transition:width .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1); }
 .time-track .lookup { background:var(--color-text); }
 .time-track .fill { background:var(--coral); }
 .time-chart p { font-size:.75rem; }
 @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .time-track i { transition:none; } }
 .cost-options { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }
 .cost-options label { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
 .cost-options input { width:7rem; accent-color:var(--color-accent); }
 .cost-path { padding:.65rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); display:grid; grid-template-columns:5rem 1fr 3.5rem; gap:.5rem; align-items:center; }
 .segments { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.35rem; }
 .segments span { background:var(--color-surface); padding:.3rem .5rem; border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); }
 .population { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(10,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.3rem; }
 .population>span { text-align:center; padding:.35rem .1rem; border:1px dashed var(--color-text-secondary); }
 .population .hit { border-style:solid; background:var(--color-accent); color:var(--color-surface); }
 .population .percentile { outline:2px solid var(--color-text); outline-offset:1px; }
 .population small { display:block; font-size:.65rem; }
 .legend { font-size:.78rem; }
 @media(max-width:540px) { .cost-path { grid-template-columns:1fr auto; } .segments { grid-row:2; grid-column:1 / -1; } }
</style>
